    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**Available Immediately ***Furnished*** ** Well-presented three double-bedroom, one bathroom semi-detached house extending to approx. 85sqm, with a garden to the rear and off-street parking. The accommodation consists of an entrance hall, a reception room to the front. To the rear a large kitchen/dining area, the kitchen is fully fitted, including a fridge/freezer, oven, hob, dishwasher, washer/dryer. Doors lead into the spacious garden, with artificial grass into a and large lawn. Downstairs bathroom with shower. Upstairs, there are three double bedrooms, all fitted with wardrobes. Third bedroom with a converted single/double bed. Ideally located on Faussagh Road and close to shops, schools and transport links. **Professionally managed by Sherry FitzGerald Lettings**"
      },
      {
